{
  "name": "Flexoki Light",
  "base": "light",
  "_comment": [
    "Flexoki-matched Claude Code theme for light backgrounds (#FFFCF0 paper).",
    "",
    "Unlike the dark variant, this needs no dim compensation. Terminals render",
    "SGR 2 by scaling the foreground toward black, which on a light background",
    "INCREASES contrast — the forced dimColor on Select-option descriptions that",
    "makes the dark theme unreadable is harmless here. So these are the plain",
    "Flexoki 600/700-series accents, no brightening games.",
    "",
    "suggestion/success/warning use the 700 step rather than 600 purely to clear",
    "4.5:1 on paper: green-600 is 4.39 and yellow-600 is 3.39, both short of AA.",
    "Recompute with agent-core/claude-themes/check-contrast.py after any edit."
  ],
